{"id":471,"date":"2022-06-21T00:00:20","date_gmt":"2022-06-20T14:30:20","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?p=471"},"modified":"2022-08-29T17:30:27","modified_gmt":"2022-08-29T08:00:27","slug":"target-keywords-and-improve-your-ads","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/target-keywords-and-improve-your-ads\/","title":{"rendered":"Two New FeedOps features to target keywords and improve your ads"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"471\" class=\"elementor elementor-471\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-242d1cf2 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"242d1cf2\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-459a3096\" data-id=\"459a3096\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2eaef35 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2eaef35\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">New Features<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8726021 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8726021\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The vast majority of people search for products using predictable patterns. Title templates allow you to optimize many product titles at once. Today FeedOps has added 2 new features to help make your product optimization experience even better:\u00a0<\/p><ul><li>The ability to add text to product titles<\/li><li>The ability to remove the original website title<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-caa0788 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"caa0788\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Case study<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4aaf79b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4aaf79b7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); font-size: 1rem;\">Here is an example of how you can use both together.<\/span><\/p><p>Say, for example that we are optimizing a product feed for a website that sells Australian made socks made from:<\/p><ul><li>Alpaca<\/li><li>Merino<\/li><li>Cotton<\/li><li>Bamboo<\/li><\/ul><p>(each of the bullet points above is a product type).<\/p><p>The predictable search pattern is &#8220;Australian Made + {Product Type} + Socks&#8221;.\u00a0 E.g. Australian Made Alpaca Wool socks<\/p><p>Using the FeedOps product title editor you can insert &#8220;Australian Made&#8221; &amp; &#8220;Socks&#8221; at either side of the product type.<\/p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image\" style=\"max-width: 1578px;\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"1578px\"><div><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/uploads-ssl.webflow.com\/60a5a09c9ca6b716b53fabe5\/62b125ccdd0b413f529ece81_Optimsing%20Product%20Title%20Text.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" \/><\/div><figcaption>Add static text to product title in bulk<\/figcaption><\/figure><p>Below are examples of what the final product title would look like in Merchant Center:<\/p><ol><li>Australian Made <strong>Alpaca Socks<\/strong> Alpaca Wool Socks (Exceptionally Warm Luxury)<\/li><li>Australian Made <strong>Merino Socks<\/strong> 90% Fine Merino Wool Winter Socks (Heavy-Knit )<\/li><li>Australian Made <strong>Socks<\/strong> 95% Mercerised Cotton Sock<\/li><li>Australian Made <strong>Bamboo Socks<\/strong> Sustainable Bamboo-Rayon Sock<\/li><\/ol><p>In most cases leaving the original title in place is a good idea because It helps to keep the product titles unique but you do have the option to refine it further to improve the readability.<\/p><p>In the example below we have drilled down to alpaca socks, the original product title has been removed completely and replaced with the text &#8220;Warm Winter Luxury&#8221; and to keep the titles for each SKU unique size and color have been added.<\/p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image\" style=\"max-width: 1518px;\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"normal\" data-rt-max-width=\"1518px\"><div><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/uploads-ssl.webflow.com\/60a5a09c9ca6b716b53fabe5\/62b1323cdbd0f727e9e07db5_Replaceing%20the%20existing%20title%20.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" \/><\/div><\/figure><p>This is what the final product title would look like in Merchant Center:<\/p><ol><li>Australian Made Alpaca Socks (Warm Winter Luxury) Small \/ Blue<\/li><li>Australian Made Alpaca Socks (Warm Winter Luxury) Small \/ Red<\/li><li>Australian Made Alpaca Socks (Warm Winter Luxury) Small \/ Green<\/li><li>Australian Made Alpaca Socks (Warm Winter Luxury) Medium \/ Blue<\/li><li>Australian Made Alpaca Socks (Warm Winter Luxury) Medium \/ Red<\/li><li>Australian Made Alpaca Socks (Warm Winter Luxury) Medium \/ Green<\/li><li>Australian Made Alpaca Socks (Warm Winter Luxury) Large \/ Blue<\/li><li>Australian Made Alpaca Socks (Warm Winter Luxury) Large \/ Red<\/li><li>Australian Made Alpaca Socks (Warm Winter Luxury) Large \/ Green<\/li><\/ol><p>This is the start of a revamp of our product data editing tools. We have planned regular releases booked for the rest of this year.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Here are 2 new features we recently added to FeedOps, that help you construct the best titles for your products in a SEM\/PPC context.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":472,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-471","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-uncategorized"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Two New FeedOps features to target keywords and improve your ads<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/target-keywords-and-improve-your-ads\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Two New FeedOps features to target keywords and improve your ads\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Here are 2 new features we recently added to FeedOps, that help you construct the best titles for your products in a SEM\/PPC context.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/target-keywords-and-improve-your-ads\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"FeedOps\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops